I build websites for fence companies around Austin. {Business Name} has good fence and gate work on its social pages, but no site a homeowner finds when they search.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: a gallery sorted by fence style, an estimate form that asks for footage and gate count, and a page for HOA and permit questions, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

https://yourstudio.com/austin/{business-name}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it out for $1,800–$3,000, plus $79–$149 a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

